<title>USA: Statewide unit chief resigns.</title>
<headline>Statewide unit chief resigns.</headline>
<dateline>JERSEY CITY, N.J. 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statewide Financial Corp said on Thursday that Clifford Adams resigned as president and chief operating officer of Statewide Savings Bank to pursue other business opportunities.</p>
<p>The resignation will take effect immediately, Statewide said.</p>
</text>
